WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 00h: Esthar city revealed
Duration: ~13 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV — cloaking barrier dissolves, revealing hidden city

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
A futuristic arch with purple lights frames empty darkness. Hexagonal floor tiles and mechanical pillars stand ready.

00:03.500 --> 00:07.000
Beyond white salt flats, a hexagonal energy barrier shimmers in the sky above snowy mountains.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
The barrier dissolves. A vast futuristic city of teal towers materializes behind the fading shield.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.100
Esthar's full skyline stretches across the horizon, gleaming cyan and silver, wasteland in the foreground.
